OL,3,CPeople inside property during petrol
OL,4,Cbomb attack
OL,6,FA number of people were inside a
OL,7,Fproperty when it was targeted in a
OL,8,Fpetrol bomb attack in Belfast.
OL,10,FPolice are investigating the incident
OL,11,Fat residential premises at the
OL,12,FHatfield Street area of the city in
OL,13,Fthe early hours of Saturday.
OL,15,FA spokesperson said: "Shortly before
OL,16,F00:50am, it was reported to police
OL,17,Fthat two masked men approached a
OL,18,Fproperty.
OL,26,@wD@VOU
