OL,3,CPeople inside property during petrol
OL,4,Cbomb attack
OL,6,F"It was reported that one of the men
OL,7,Fthrew a petrol bomb at the front of
OL,8,Fthe house, which ignited and caused
OL,9,Fdamage to a window.
OL,11,F"The second man threw another object
OL,12,Fat the property, but it did not ignite.
OL,14,F"The men made off towards the Balfour
OL,15,FAvenue area and the fire was
OL,16,Fextinguished by colleagues from the
OL,17,FNorthern Ireland Fire and Rescue
OL,18,FService.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUvD@AOU
