CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786889891
OL,3,CPeople inside property during petrol
OL,4,Cbomb attack
OL,6,F"A number of people were inside the
OL,7,Fproperty at the time of the incident,
OL,8,Fbut there were no reports of any
OL,9,Finjuries."
OL,11,FInquiries into the incident are
OL,12,Fcontinuing.
